# The lesson's result and Free Play (docs/LEARNING.md "The lesson panel", "The input
# lock"; docs/BUILDING.md "Input scripts"), on tutorial 1 at its last step: Enter closes
# the result (Keep Playing) and is not also End Turn; Free Play, switched on in this
# lesson, is off again when the next lesson starts.
# layouts: both (also plays at 800x600: run_input_tests.py --small)
options --tutorial=first-steps:15 --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800

wait-lesson first-steps
click tag:lesson:free-play
click tag:command:designs
wait-window designs
key Escape
wait-closed designs
click item:Finish in=lesson
wait-result done
wait-for item:"Keep Playing"
key Enter
wait-gone item:"Keep Playing"
wait 5
assert-absent item:Yes in="End Turn"
assert-turn 0
# Back to the Learn window, and the next tutorial: locked again.
click tag:lesson:leave
wait-screen front
wait-for item:"Start Lesson" in=front
click item:"Exploring and colonizing" in=front
click item:"Start Lesson" in=front
wait-screen game
wait-lesson exploring-and-colonizing
click tag:command:designs refused
assert-no-window designs
